 "operation": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.1 Initial Display",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Criteria: SA Date From = 1st day of previous month, To = system date (TBD); Status and Truck Company = All; tab Service Acceptance List.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Access: VPLD / IELP Admin all SA; Supplier own trucking company; Driver no access (message no. 1).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Only SA generated by SA Approval (SA Number present) are shown; this screen never generates an SA Number (SM-01).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "d.",
   "text": "Two SA types: Delivery (route-based delivery cost) and Monthly Truck (monthly truck cost of a released Fixed Cost PO, refer UISS SA Approval 5.9).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.2 Search",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "SA approval date in range; SA Number / Delivery Number / PAS PR / PAS PO contains; Status = Interface Status; Truck Company = code; Delivery Date equals; PAS PO empty.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Sort SA Approval Date descending, SA Number; server-side paging 10 / 25 / 50. No data: 'No Data Found' (message no. 2).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.3 ELIPS data vs PAS data",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "ELIPS (SA Approval snapshot, read only): SA Number, SA Det No, deliveries, trucking, route, Total KM, ELIPS cost reference PO, rate, cost, approval date / by (SM-10).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "PAS feedback: PAS PR Number, PAS PR Date, PAS PO Number - empty until received; never generated by ELIPS, PR Date never taken from SA / interface / system date (SM-03).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "The ELIPS PO used for cost is never overwritten by the PAS PO Number (SM-04).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.4 WBS columns",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Percentage per WBS (CS, RRE, RRR, SP, CE, CI) from the service type of the cycles; cost = Price x percentage. Source WBS Consumption Master and service type: TBD (OQ-10).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.5 Interface Status",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "level": 2,
   "columns": [
    {
     "title": "Code",
     "width": 10
    },
    {
     "title": "Label",
     "width": 10
    },
    {
     "title": "Meaning",
     "width": 26
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "NOT_SENT",
     "Not Sent",
     "Approved, not yet sent"
    ],
    [
     "PROCESSING",
     "Processing",
     "Send in progress"
    ],
    [
     "SENT",
     "Sent - Waiting PAS",
     "Accepted by PAS, waiting feedback"
    ],
    [
     "PR_RECEIVED",
     "PR Received",
     "PAS PR No + Date received"
    ],
    [
     "PO_RECEIVED",
     "PO Received",
     "PAS PO received, PR not yet"
    ],
    [
     "COMPLETED",
     "Completed",
     "PR and PO received"
    ],
    [
     "FAILED",
     "Failed",
     "Send failed or PAS error"
    ]
   ],
   "row_lines": "all"
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Status = COMPLETED if PR and PO, PR_RECEIVED if PR only, PO_RECEIVED if PO only, SENT if none; FAILED on send error or PAS error feedback (SM-07). Existing ELIPS-PAS standard replaces this model (OQ-02).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Overdue flag: SENT / PR / PO received without feedback for more than 24 h (TBD). Visual only.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "column_break"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.6 Detail",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Sections A-G with source labels (ELIPS / PAS feedback). Read only.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.7 Interface Log / Audit",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Events SA_APPROVED, SA_SENT_TO_PAS, PAS_REQUEST_SUCCESS, PAS_REQUEST_FAILED, PAS_PR_RECEIVED, PAS_PO_RECEIVED, PAS_FEEDBACK_FAILED, PAS_PROCESS_COMPLETED with time, actor, correlation ID, previous / new status, error.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.8 Retry Interface",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "1.",
   "text": "Shown for FAILED SA without PAS values; enabled only with the retry authorization (IELP Admin, proposed, OQ-08); backend checks again (message no. 6).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "2.",
   "text": "Status PROCESSING, attempt + 1, same correlation ID; result SENT (message no. 4) or FAILED with error (message no. 5).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "3.",
   "text": "PAS-side failure (PR / PO creation failed) is not resent; PAS sends the missing data later (message no. 7).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.9 Background processes (outside this screen)",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Interface batch: sends NOT_SENT SA from the outbox, retries PAS_UNAVAILABLE / TIMEOUT automatically (5, 15, 60 min, 3 attempts - TBD).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "PAS feedback API: idempotent by feedback id; matched by SA Number + correlation ID; staged PR then PO update the same SA; conflicts, unknown SA, missing PR No / PR Date / PO No rejected and logged; PO received sets Daily orders 'SA Approved with PO Number'. Refer UISS-Batch PAS Interface (TBD) and docs/sa-monitoring-spec.md \u00a713-\u00a720.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Integration errors never remove an SA from this screen (SM-11).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.10 Open Questions",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "level": 2,
   "columns": [
    {
     "title": "ID",
     "width": 6
    },
    {
     "title": "Question",
     "width": 40
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "OQ-01",
     "PAS interface contract (push / file / queue, content, feedback channel, auth)."
    ],
    [
     "OQ-02",
     "Existing ELIPS-PAS status standard; definition of Completed."
    ],
    [
     "OQ-03",
     "Content of tab Service Acceptance List (WBS Group)."
    ],
    [
     "OQ-04",
     "SA Date different from approval date?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-05",
     "May PAS correct PR / PO numbers after sending?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-06",
     "Uniqueness of PAS PR / PAS PO across SA."
    ],
    [
     "OQ-07",
     "Feedback timeout threshold; reminder / e-mail?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-08",
     "Who may retry / resend / correct / cancel?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-09",
     "SA Det No format."
    ],
    [
     "OQ-10",
     "Service Type source and WBS Consumption Master rule."
    ],
    [
     "OQ-11",
     "PAS PO feedback updates Daily Monitoring status?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-13",
     "PAS PR / PO per SA header or per delivery?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-14",
     "Definition of tab Inter Plant."
    ],
    [
     "OQ-15",
     "Excel export layout and maximum rows."
    ]
   ],
   "row_lines": "all"
  }
 ],
